       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INSPECT-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 MESSAGE-TEXT PIC X(30) VALUE "BANANA BREAD AND BANANA JAM".
       01 LETTER-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           INSPECT MESSAGE-TEXT TALLYING LETTER-COUNT
               FOR ALL "A".
           DISPLAY "NUMBER OF A LETTERS: " LETTER-COUNT.
           INSPECT MESSAGE-TEXT REPLACING ALL "BANANA" BY "ORANGE".
           DISPLAY "UPDATED TEXT: " MESSAGE-TEXT.
           STOP RUN.
